rd to use a higher card (K or 2 if they have it).  \n- It signals to my teammate that I have some strength left.  \n- Saves RedJoker for later when it can block a landlord’s winning move.  \n\n---\n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♣Q"]}'}
